# This repo root doubles as the live CNC12 controller install directory on
# the control PC (job files, logs, backups, position/tool state, third-party
# exes/dlls, etc.). Only a curated set of PLC source/config/doc files should
# ever be tracked, so ignore everything by default and explicitly un-ignore
# what belongs in git. This also covers compiler scratch output (mpu.plc,
# plc.map, plc.out, mpu.dbg, mpu.sym, xplc.sym, mpu-stats.txt) without listing
# each one -- these are regenerated whenever the .src is compiled (locally or on
# the control PC), so there is no value in committing them.
/*

!/.claude/
!/docs/
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/LICENSE.md
!/README.md
!/Centroid-Acroloc-ALLIN1DC.src
!/compile.sh
!/tools/
/tools/__pycache__/
!/mfunc*.mac
!/mpucomp.exe
!/plcmsg.txt
!/language.msg
!/resources/

# Large vendor manual kept as a local-only reference (~57 MB); the other
# docs/official/*.pdf manuals stay tracked.
/docs/official/centroid-cnc12-mill-operator-manual.pdf
.superpowers/
